{"approved":false,"back_sample":null,"beam_size":2,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":true,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":true,"protected_values":true,"translated":true},"context":"compression-ratio-calculator UI copy.howAnswer","detected_language":"nl","format":"usefulverse-background-draft-v1","key":"compression-ratio-calculator.copy.howAnswer","keys":["compression-ratio-calculator.copy.howAnswer"],"locale":"nl","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","raw_translation":"De statische verhouding is (geveegd volume + vrij volume) ÷ vrij volume. Geveegd volume komt van boring en slag. Vrijheid combineert kamer, kop-pakking, dek en zuiger-kroon volumes. Een ZXQPH0000QXZ cc geveegd volume en ZXQPH0001QXZ cc vrij volume geven ZXQPH0002QXZ: ZXQPH0003QXZ.","record_id":"d8e20f911a9054db940ac3ae6fc490c56e1fdaa28627a0c6c832300360787780","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","run_id":"40843674935","seconds":2.9678825188749443,"source":"The static ratio is (swept volume + clearance volume) ÷ clearance volume. Swept volume comes from bore and stroke. Clearance combines chamber, head-gasket, deck and piston-crown volumes. A 9 cc swept volume and 1 cc clearance volume give 10:1.","source_commit":"e1f72394198c1a94fce448ea14cd79b496701273","source_hash":"7f1b9a876212f35745c97510b1a02f7994170aa52b4d60a12f7357c7e2398c83","status":"machine-draft","translation":"De statische verhouding is (geveegd volume + vrij volume) ÷ vrij volume. Geveegd volume komt van boring en slag. Vrijheid combineert kamer, kop-pakking, dek en zuiger-kroon volumes. Een 9 cc geveegd volume en 1 cc vrij volume geven 10: 1.","truncated":false,"warnings":[]}
